{"metadata":{"title":"simplified","externalID":"s:12XestiNumbers6NumberV10simplifiedACvp","modules":[{"name":"XestiNumbers"}],"extendedModule":"XestiNumbers","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"simplified"},{"kind":"text","text":": `Self`"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"The simplest internal representation of this number.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers","doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers\/Number"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"simplified"},{"kind":"text","text":": `Self`"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this number is already in the simplest internal representation, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this number itself is returned."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A number may be represented internally by a variety of data structures.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"For example, there are different data structures for representing","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"“large” and “small” exact integers, exact fractions, floating-point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values, and complex numbers. Performing a numeric operation may result","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"in a number with a representation containing extraneous information."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, the  numbers ","type":"text"},{"code":"5\/4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"3\/4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are represented internally by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data structures that contain the numerator and denominator of each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"number. (Something like, ","type":"text"},{"code":"{ numerator: 5, denominator: 4 }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"{ numerator: 3, denominator: 4 }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", respectively.) Adding those numbers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"together results in the number ","type":"text"},{"code":"2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". However, for efficiency, that result","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also represented internally by a data structure that contains ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a numerator "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"text":" a denominator. (Something like, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"{ numerator: 2, denominator: 1 }"},{"text":".) In this case, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"simplified"},{"text":" property would","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"simplify the internal representation to contain ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"only"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the (exact)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integer result."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/xestinumbers\/number\/simplified"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers\/Number\/simplified","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://XestiNumbers/documentation/XestiNumbers/Number/simplified":{"title":"simplified","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The simplest internal representation of this number."}],"url":"\/documentation\/xestinumbers\/number\/simplified","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"simplified"},{"kind":"text","text":": `Self`"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers\/Number\/simplified","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://XestiNumbers/documentation/XestiNumbers":{"title":"XestiNumbers","abstract":[{"text":"A Swift number tower.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/xestinumbers","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://XestiNumbers/documentation/XestiNumbers/Number":{"title":"Number","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A generalized numeric value that supports a “number tower” patterned after"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that in the Scheme programming language."}],"url":"\/documentation\/xestinumbers\/number","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Number"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Number"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/XestiNumbers\/documentation\/XestiNumbers\/Number","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}